{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t在巴西總統選舉落選的弗拉維奧，懷疑違反法院禁令離境，據報經阿根廷和厄瓜多爾前往美國，預計星期三上午抵達邁阿密。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n美國總統特朗普表示，會批准弗拉維奧入境，美國國務院表示，將向弗拉維奧及家人發放簽證。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n巴西現任總統盧拉批評弗拉維奧離境行為可恥，應該就當局的指控作出解釋。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:41.532510+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:53:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T08:38:57.297557+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:37.219181+00:00","content_hash":"384622de8810da0202c5ef7feeeec912a26942aef37fd52dbfda2dca3d025375","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}